        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>笔记文档</title>\n  <script>\n    window.MathJax = {\n      tex: { inlineMath: [['$', '$'], ['\\\\(', '\\\\)']], displayMath: [['$$', '$$'], ['\\\\[', '\\\\]']] },\n      svg: { fontCache: 'global' }\n    };\n  </script>\n  <script async src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-svg.js\"></script>\n  <style>\n    * { box-sizing: border-box; }\n    html, body {\n      margin: 0;\n      min-height: 100%;\n      background: #22282a;\n      color: #26313a;\n      font-family: \"KaiTi\", \"STKaiti\", \"FangSong\", serif;\n    }\n    body {\n      display: flex;\n      justify-content: center;\n      align-items: center;\n      padding: 22px;\n    }\n    .notebook {\n      position: relative;\n      display: grid;\n      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;\n      width: min(1120px, 96vw);\n      min-height: 720px;\n      transform: rotate(-0.4deg);\n      filter: drop-shadow(0 12px 12px rgba(0,0,0,.45));\n    }\n    .page {\n      position: relative;\n      overflow: hidden;\n      padding: 30px 26px 25px;\n      background-color: #f0f0db;\n      background-image:\n        linear-gradient(rgba(75, 116, 121, .23) 1px, transparent 1px),\n        linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(75, 116, 121, .23) 1px, transparent 1px);\n      background-size: 18px 18px;\n      border: 1px solid #b6b7a5;\n    }\n    .left {\n      border-radius: 5px 0 0 5px;\n      padding-right: 42px;\n    }\n    .right {\n      border-radius: 0 5px 5px 0;\n      padding-left: 42px;\n    }\n    .binding {\n      position: absolute;\n      z-index: 4;\n      left: 50%;\n      top: 0;\n      bottom: 0;\n      width: 30px;\n      transform: translateX(-50%);\n      pointer-events: none;\n      background:\n        radial-gradient(ellipse at center, #555 0 16%, transparent 18%) 50% 20px / 24px 36px repeat-y,\n        linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(0,0,0,.18), rgba(255,255,255,.32) 50%, rgba(0,0,0,.18));\n      opacity: .78;\n    }\n    .binding:before,\n    .binding:after {\n      content: \"\";\n      position: absolute;\n      left: 4px;\n      width: 22px;\n      height: 27px;\n      border: 3px solid #68685c;\n      border-left-color: #b4b49d;\n      border-right-color: #aaa994;\n      border-radius: 50%;\n      box-shadow: 0 1px 2px #333;\n    }\n    .binding:before { top: 19px; }\n    .binding:after { top: 55px; }\n    .heading {\n      text-align: center;\n      font-size: 19px;\n      font-weight: bold;\n      margin: 0 0 13px;\n      color: #303c44;\n    }\n    .section {\n      margin: 0 0 12px;\n      font-size: 15px;\n      line-height: 1.65;\n      letter-spacing: .02em;\n    }\n    .section p { margin: 0; }\n    .red { color: #9a4f52; }\n    .blue { color: #455f87; }\n    .underline {\n      border-bottom: 1px solid #8e5557;\n      padding-bottom: 1px;\n    }\n    .box {\n      border: 1px solid #7c8580;\n      padding: 5px 8px;\n      margin: 7px 0;\n      line-height: 1.6;\n      background: rgba(245,245,222,.2);\n    }\n    .arrow {\n      width: 70px;\n      height: 32px;\n      margin: 3px 0 2px 75px;\n      position: relative;\n    }\n    .arrow:before {\n      content: \"\";\n      position: absolute;\n      left: 8px;\n      top: 14px;\n      width: 46px;\n      border-top: 1px solid #56615e;\n    }\n    .arrow:after {\n      content: \"↓\";\n      position: absolute;\n      left: 28px;\n      top: -8px;\n      font-size: 35px;\n      color: #56615e;\n    }\n    .two-col {\n      display: grid;\n      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;\n      gap: 12px;\n    }\n    .small { font-size: 14px; }\n    .large-space { margin-top: 23px; }\n    .signature {\n      text-align: right;\n      margin-top: 22px;\n      font-size: 14px;\n    }\n    @media (max-width: 760px) {\n      body { padding: 8px; align-items: flex-start; }\n      .notebook {\n        width: 1040px;\n        min-height: 690px;\n        transform: scale(.69);\n        transform-origin: top left;\n        margin-bottom: -210px;\n      }\n    }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <main class=\"notebook\" aria-label=\"手写笔记\">\n    <div class=\"page left\">\n      <div class=\"heading\">三、[illegible]</div>\n\n      <section class=\"section\">\n        <p>原题中，若函数图象经过点，须先确定其定义域和值域，再求解析式。</p>\n        <p class=\"red\">注意：函数的定义域不能忽略，图象应在定义域内作出。</p>\n      </section>\n\n      <section class=\"section\">\n        <p><span class=\"blue\">（1）</span>先根据题意列出关系式，写出变量之间的对应关系：</p>\n        <div class=\"box\">\n          <span class=\"red\">设自变量为 $x$，因变量为 $y$。</span><br>\n          $y=f(x)$，其中 $x\\in[?，?]$。\n        </div>\n      </section>\n\n      <section class=\"section\">\n        <p><span class=\"blue\">（2）</span>求函数的解析式，并判断函数的单调性。</p>\n        <p>由题意得：<span class=\"red underline\">[illegible] = [illegible]</span></p>\n        <p>所以函数的图象如图所示。</p>\n      </section>\n\n      <section class=\"section\">\n        <p><span class=\"blue\">（3）</span>当 $x=[?]$ 时，函数值最大（或最小）。</p>\n        <div class=\"box\">\n          <span class=\"red\">函数的图象与坐标轴交点：</span><br>\n          $x=[?]$，$y=[?]$。\n        </div>\n      </section>\n\n      <div class=\"arrow\"></div>\n\n      <section class=\"section\">\n        <p><span class=\"blue\">4. 典型例题</span></p>\n        <p>已知函数 $f(x)= [illegible]$，求 $f([?])$ 的值。</p>\n        <p class=\"red\">解：把 $x=[?]$ 代入函数解析式，得</p>\n        <p>$f([?])=[?]$。</p>\n      </section>\n\n      <section class=\"section large-space\">\n        <p><span class=\"blue\">5. 方法总结</span></p>\n        <p>求函数值时，首先要看清自变量的取值，再代入解析式计算。</p>\n      </section>\n\n      <section class=\"section small\">\n        <p class=\"red\">（1）定义域；（2）对应法则；（3）值域。</p>\n        <p>以上三点是函数的基本要素。</p>\n      </section>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"page right\">\n      <div class=\"heading\">例题与练习</div>\n\n      <section class=\"section\">\n        <p><span class=\"blue\">（一）</span>选择题</p>\n        <p>1. 下列各式中，能表示 $y$ 是 $x$ 的函数的是（　）</p>\n        <div class=\"box\">\n          A. $[illegible]$　B. $[illegible]$<br>\n          C. $[illegible]$　D. $[illegible]$\n        </div>\n      </section>\n\n      <section class=\"section\">\n        <p>2. 函数 $y=[illegible]$ 的定义域为（　）</p>\n        <p class=\"red\">解：使解析式有意义，必须满足：[illegible]</p>\n      </section>\n\n      <section class=\"section\">\n        <p><span class=\"blue\">（二）</span>填空题</p>\n        <p>若函数 $f(x)=[illegible]$，则 $f(2)=[?]$。</p>\n        <p>函数的图象经过点 $([?],[?])$。</p>\n      </section>\n\n      <section class=\"section\">\n        <p><span class=\"blue\">（三）</span>解答题</p>\n        <p>已知一次函数的图象经过点 $A$、$B$，求这个一次函数的解析式。</p>\n        <div class=\"box\">\n          <p class=\"red\">解：设一次函数为 $y=kx+b$。</p>\n          <p>把点 $A([?],[?])$、$B([?],[?])$ 代入，得</p>\n          <p>$\\begin{cases} [?]=k[?]+b \\\\ [?]=k[?]+b \\end{cases}$</p>\n          <p>解得 $k=[?]$，$b=[?]$。</p>\n          <p class=\"underline\">所以 $y=[illegible]$。</p>\n        </div>\n      </section>\n\n      <section class=\"section\">\n        <p><span class=\"blue\">（4）</span>函数图象与性质</p>\n        <p>在同一坐标系中画出函数图象，并指出增减性。</p>\n        <div class=\"box\">\n          <span class=\"red\">当 $k&gt;0$ 时，函数值随 $x$ 的增大而增大；</span><br>\n          当 $k&lt;0$ 时，函数值随 $x$ 的增大而减小。\n        </div>\n      </section>\n\n      <section class=\"section\">\n        <p><span class=\"blue\">六、课堂练习</span></p>\n        <p>1. 求下列函数的定义域和值域。</p>\n        <p>2. 根据函数图象回答问题。</p>\n        <p>3. 求函数的最大值和最小值。</p>\n      </section>\n\n      <div class=\"two-col\">\n        <section class=\"section small\">\n          <p class=\"red\">易错点：</p>\n          <p>定义域写错；<br>计算时漏掉括号；<br>图象方向判断错误。</p>\n        </section>\n        <section class=\"section small\">\n          <p class=\"blue\">作业：</p>\n          <p>完成课本第 [?] 页<br>练习题 [?]、[?]。</p>\n        </section>\n      </div>\n\n      <p class=\"signature\">[illegible]</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"binding\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\n  </main>\n</body>\n</html>"
